        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pescoço Longo. Embora seja muito pequeno, o cérebro na cauda de Girafarig é considerado um órgão importante, pois emite uma poderosa energia psíquica. Essa cauda possui uma pequena cabeça que morde instintivamente qualquer inimigo que se aproxime por trás.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 6 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Girafarig pode evoluir para Farigiraf no momento em que aprende o Move ‘Twin Beam’. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Astonish, Confusion, Growl, Guard Swap, Power Swap, Tackle Odor Sleuth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Assurance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Stomp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Psyb e am</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Double Hit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Twin Beam, Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Baton Pass</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Nasty Plot, Psychic</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Ally Switch, Amnesia, Attract, Baton Pass, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Crunch, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dream Eater, Earthquake, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Foul Play, Frustration, Future Sight, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Gravity, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Hyper Beam, Hyper Voice, Imprison, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Low Kick, Magic Coat, Nasty Plot, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Fangs, Psychic Noise, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stomping Tantrum, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ally Switch, Amnesia, Beat Up, Double Kick, Foresight, Future Sight, Magic Coat, Mean Look, Mirror Coat, Psychic Fangs, Psychic Terrain, Razor Wind, Secret Power, Skill Swap, Take Down, Uproar, Wish</p>",
